#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Lint technical prose and maintain a project glossary.

We adapted the surface-form checks from woosal1337/blog's
videos/ep01-the-cure-for-ai-slop/ste-lint.py (MIT), reviewed at commit
1de95f861304d71f028f7cc6ef3f171bb2c59f05. This implementation adds
configuration, diagnostics, glossary enforcement, and project term discovery.
It does not certify ASD-STE100 conformance.
"""

